---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions — PackersHub"
  description="PackersHub Terms and Conditions — Service terms, payment, liability, insurance, cancellation policy."
  canonical="https://www.packershub.in/terms/"
>
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-6">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-brand-grey" role="list">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-orange">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-hidden="true">›</li>
          <li class="text-brand-orange font-semibold" aria-current="page">Terms & Conditions</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-4xl text-brand-dark mb-4">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="text-brand-grey mb-8"><time datetime="2026-08-21">Last updated: August 21, 2026</time></p>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-brand-grey">
        <h2>1. Service Agreement</h2>
        <p>By booking PackersHub services, you agree to these terms. Services include packing, transport, storage, and related moving services across South India.</p>
        <h2>2. Pricing & Payment</h2>
        <p>All quotes are valid for 7 days. Final charges may vary based on actual goods volume. GST applicable at prevailing rates. Payment accepted: Cash, UPI, NEFT, Card.</p>
        <h2>3. Insurance & Liability</h2>
        <p>All shipments include basic transit insurance. Claims must be reported within 24 hours of delivery. Maximum liability limited to declared value of goods.</p>
        <h2 id="cancellation-refund-policy">4. Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</h2>
        <p>We keep this simple, fair, and fully transparent — no fine print, no surprise deductions.</p>

        <h3>4.1 Free Rescheduling — Anytime, No Limit</h3>
        <p>Plans change. Reschedule your move date as many times as you need, at no extra cost, by telling us at least 24 hours before your originally scheduled slot — no rebooking fee, no fresh paperwork, no re-verification.</p>

        <h3>4.2 24-Hour No-Questions-Asked Window</h3>
        <p>Changed your mind right after booking? Cancel within 24 hours of your booking confirmation and get a <strong>100% refund of your advance payment, no questions asked</strong> — regardless of how close your move date is.</p>

        <h3>4.3 Cancellation Refund Slabs (After the 24-Hour Window)</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>7+ days before the move:</strong> 100% refund of the advance paid.</li>
          <li><strong>3–6 days before the move:</strong> 50% refund of the advance paid.</li>
          <li><strong>Less than 72 hours before the move:</strong> the advance is non-refundable — by this point our crew, vehicle, and packing materials are already reserved specifically for your slot. You can still reschedule for free instead of cancelling outright (see 4.1).</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>4.4 If We're the Ones Who Fail You</h3>
        <p>If our crew does not arrive within your confirmed slot without prior notice from us, you get a 100% refund of your advance, no matter which slab above would otherwise apply.</p>

        <h3>4.5 Refund Timeline</h3>
        <p>Approved refunds are processed back to your original payment method (UPI, card, or net banking via Razorpay). You'll get a confirmation message the moment a refund is initiated.</p>

        <h3>4.6 Force Majeure</h3>
        <p>For cancellations caused by events outside anyone's control (natural disasters, government-mandated restrictions, strikes, etc.), we issue a full credit note for your next move instead of applying the slabs above — no advance is forfeited.</p>

        <h3>4.7 How to Cancel or Reschedule</h3>
        <p>WhatsApp or call us at <a href="tel:+917731074075" class="text-brand-orange">+91 77310 74075</a>, or use your Tracking ID on the <a href="/track/" class="text-brand-orange">Track page</a> — no login or written application needed.</p>

        <h2>5. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:info@packershub.in" class="text-brand-orange">info@packershub.in</a> · <a href="tel:+917731074075" class="text-brand-orange">+91 77310 74075</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
